{'symbol': 'AEP', 'date': '2022-10-03 14:00:00', 'title': 'AEP NAMES MAJTENYI VICE PRESIDENT OF GENERATION PROJECT SOLUTIONS', 'text': 'COLUMBUS, OHIO , OCT. 3, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AMERICAN ELECTRIC POWER (NASDAQ: AEP) HAS NAMED JULIET MAJTENYI VICE PRESIDENT OF PROJECT SOLUTIONS, GENERATION, EFFECTIVE OCT. 22. SHE REPLACES FRANK PIFER, WHO WILL RETIRE AFTER MORE THAN 35 YEARS WITH THE COMPANY.'}